- STG/ZRO ratio. The "5.4% discount to parity" was a single-snapshot reading. Within an hour the implied ratio ranged from 0.0816 to 0.0891 around the 0.08634 parity, so the claim was replaced with the observed range. The unsupported "converted holders often sell" was softened.

- DefiLlama vs Foundation monthly match. The claimed "±25%" was replaced with the measured -18% to +30%.

