#### Still unverified

- People and news (web search unavailable). The web-search quota was exhausted during this fact-check as well. As a result, the current roles and X handles of co-founders Ryan Zarick and Caleb Banister were not checked against an official page, nor was the absence of executive departures. Third-party news, including litigation or regulatory action after KelpDAO, was also not checked.

- Company-reported figures. These were not independently verifiable on-chain: unlock sell-through, institutional purchases, market-share percentages (70% of stablecoin flow, 80–87% of cross-chain volume), $300B lifetime volume and Labs revenue.

- Contributor schedule and future dates. The contributor unlock schedule and the Zero mainnet date are not public. The date of fee-switch vote #5 is an estimate from the 6-month cadence.

