| --- | --- | --- |

| Hard cap (protocol SupplyCap) | 720,000,000 AVAX | AvalancheGo reward config; [Avalanche docs](https://build.avax.network/docs/primary-network/avax-token) |

| P-Chain CurrentSupply counter | 475,987,384.02 AVAX (P-Chain height 25,840,706) | platform.getCurrentSupply. The counter includes rewards optimistically pre-added for active stakers and does not subtract burned fees (per docs) |

