    ('plasma:XPL', 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UDH_MCpkWpYyKJfOEWICiH0m4VLMGSVbTz8Wd9pWZ3k/edit', $tank_seed_XPL_20261110$## XPL — Plasma: token & protocol fact sheet

As of 2026-11-10. All live numbers were pulled on 2026-11-10 between 15:27 and 15:45 UTC unless stated otherwise; values refreshed by the independent fact-check (16:15–16:20 UTC) are marked with that time. See the Verification notes at the end. "Est." marks estimates. Research note: the web-search quota for this run was exhausted before the news pass, so the news section is built from primary sources only (Plasma blog, legal terms, status page, Aave governance forum, DefiLlama/CoinGecko time series, on-chain reads). Third-party press coverage from the last 90 days was not reviewed. Check X (@plasma) and the press before trading on this sheet.

### 1. Executive summary

XPL is the native gas and (planned) staking token of Plasma. Plasma is an EVM Layer 1 built for USD₮ (USDT0) payments. The same company also runs a consumer neobank and card app, Plasma One. Today no value reaches XPL holders. The chain earned only about $6.3k in gas fees over the last 30 days (DefiLlama). The documented EIP-1559 burn is effectively zero: the base fee sits at 8–13 wei (re-checked 2026-11-10 16:16 UTC over the last 1,024 blocks). I verified on-chain that all priority fees go to a 5-of-8 Safe multisig (block coinbase 0x…0a11b005). That Safe now holds about 1.17M XPL and has never sent any XPL out. The token trades at $0.0527 (CoinGecko, 2026-11-10 16:15 UTC), about 5% above the $0.05 public-sale price ($500M FDV). It is down about 97% from the $1.68 ATH of 2025-09-27 and 41% over the last 30 days. Since the team and investor cliff on 2026-09-25, about 228M XPL (≈$12.0M at spot) unlocks every month until September 2028. The ecosystem is shrinking: chain TVL fell from a peak of $6.36B to $0.43B. There are two counter-signals. Stablecoin supply on Plasma is rising again ($1.28B → $1.51B since 2026-09-19), and Plasma One is growing (TVL $1M → $31M since May 2026) and now uses XPL locks for its paid tiers. The most important thing to watch is whether XPL lock demand from Plasma One and real fee capture (staking, a fee switch, or burns) can absorb about 228M XPL of monthly unlocks.

### 2. What the token is

- Ticker / name: XPL / Plasma. CoinGecko id plasma, market-cap rank #143 ([CoinGecko API](https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/plasma), 2026-11-10).

- Native chain: Plasma Mainnet Beta, chain ID 9745. XPL is the native gas coin, like ETH on Ethereum. Public RPC: https://rpc.plasma.to (rate-limited). Explorer: [plasmascan.to](https://plasmascan.to/) ([docs](https://docs.plasma.org/docs/plasma-chain/network-information/connect-to-plasma.md)). I verified eth_chainId = 0x2611 = 9745.

- Wrapped XPL on Plasma: WXPL9 0x6100E367285b01F48D07953803A2d8dCA5D19873, totalSupply = 275,798,326 WXPL (on-chain read, 2026-11-10 16:16 UTC; 275,422,056 at 15:40 UTC) ([contracts list](https://docs.plasma.org/docs/plasma-chain/network-information/plasma-contracts.md)).

- BNB Chain representation: 0x405FBC9004D857903BFD6B3357792D71A50726B0. On-chain I confirmed name "Plasma", symbol "XPL", 18 decimals, verified contract name PlasmaOFT (a LayerZero OFT), totalSupply 261,433,381 XPL (BSC RPC + Etherscan V2, 2026-11-10). There is no contract at that address on Ethereum, Arbitrum or Base. CoinGecko lists no contract platforms.

- Price / valuation: $0.052684. Market cap $251.0M, FDV $527.1M, 24h volume $25.5M. ATH $1.68 (2025-09-27). ATL $0.050342 (2026-11-09). Price change: 7d −17.9%, 30d −41.0%, 60d −38.7%, 1y −82.7% ([CoinGecko](https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/plasma), 2026-11-10 16:15 UTC; the first pull at 15:27 UTC showed $0.053647, market cap $255.4M).

