### 9. Key people

- Paul Faecks: CEO of Plasma, confirmed by the official [USD₮0 blog post](https://www.plasma.org/company/blog/usdt0-plasma-advancing-global-stablecoin-adoption) ("Paul Faecks, CEO of Plasma") and listed on the [About page](https://www.plasma.org/company/about). The "co-founder" title and the X handle @pauliepunt come from 2025 secondary coverage and were not verified against a primary source. Before Plasma he co-founded Alloy (institutional digital-asset infrastructure) according to 2025 press; not re-verified.

- Jacob Wittman: General Counsel. Leads licensing (Italy VASP, MiCA CASP, EMI) ([blog](https://www.plasma.org/company/blog/licensing-our-payments-stack-to-reach-global-scale)).

- Adam Jacobs: Head of Global Payments (same blog).

- Zaheer Ebtikar: named as an angel/advisor in the Feb 2025 raise. Now listed on the Plasma team page (role not stated). Founder of Split Capital per public profiles; not re-verified.

- Other team members listed on the About page include Andy Bao, Pascal Bourgi, Usmann Khan, Hans Behrens, Ram Sevilimedu and Rick Morrow (about 40 names, no titles). There is also a Chief Compliance Officer and an MLRO in the Netherlands (names not published).

- Structure: one Cayman parent company (Plasma), plus Plasma Labs UK Ltd. (London HQ), Plasma MENA FZE (UAE) and Plasma US, Inc. There is no foundation-run DAO and no token governance. The Discord invite is discord.com/invite/plasmafdn, suggesting a foundation brand.

- Investors and strategic backers:

- Seed + Series A, $24M (2025-02-13), led by Framework and Bitfinex/USD₮0, with DRW/Cumberland, Bybit, Flow Traders, 6th Man Ventures, IMC, Nomura and Karatage. Angels: Paolo Ardoino (Tether CEO), Peter Thiel, Cobie, Zaheer Ebtikar.

- Founders Fund strategic round (2025-05-22) at a $500M valuation.

- Public sale on Echo/Sonar (2025-07-17 to 07-28): $50M cap, $373M committed.

Sources: the [$24M blog](https://www.plasma.org/company/blog/plasma-raises-24m-led-by-framework-and-bitfinex-usdt0-to-build-the-leading-blockchain-for-stablecoins), the [Founders Fund blog](https://www.plasma.org/company/blog/accelerating-global-stablecoin-adoption-with-founders-fund) and the [mainnet blog](https://www.plasma.org/company/blog/plasma-mainnet-beta-and-xpl).

- Official X: [@plasma](https://x.com/plasma) (linked from plasma.org).

- Departures: not assessed. No primary-source signal was found in this run.

