### Verification notes

Independent fact-check performed on 2026-11-10 between 16:10 and 16:40 UTC. Web search was unavailable to the fact-checker (quota exhausted), so all checks used direct API/RPC calls and direct fetches of the cited primary pages.

#### Re-checked and confirmed

- Chain and contracts: eth_chainId = 0x2611 (9745). WXPL 0x6100E367…9873 has code on Plasma and matches the official contracts list. USD₮0 0xB8CE59FC…5ebb returns symbol "USDT0". The BSC address 0x405FBC90…26B0 is a verified contract named PlasmaOFT (Etherscan V2, chainid 56), with totalSupply 261,433,381.35 XPL. eth_getCode returns empty on Ethereum, Arbitrum and Base. CoinGecko lists no contract platforms.

- Supply and vesting: CoinGecko circulating supply is 4,761,111,111 XPL, total supply 10B and max supply null. The tokenomics docs confirm the 10/40/25/25 split, the 2026-07-28 US unlock, the 2026-09-25 cliff and the 2028-09-25 end date, plus 5%→3% inflation that only starts once delegation goes live and the "base fees burned" statement. The monthly unlock works out to 3.2B/36 + 3.333B/24 = 227.8M XPL.

- Fees/revenue: I re-queried DefiLlama dailyFees, dailyRevenue and dailyHoldersRevenue. All three return identical values: 24h $44, 7d $637, 30d $6,340, 1y $110,891, all-time $272,086. Methodology: "Revenue: Burned coins". Monthly totals (Oct 2025 $87.9k, Dec 2025 $7.5k, Mar 2026 $4.3k, May 2026 $0.5k, Sep 2026 $19.2k, Oct 2026 $7.4k) match.

- Fee flow on-chain: I recomputed blocks 37,381,764, 37,381,763 and 37,381,759 independently. Tips were 0.016170, 0.017316 and 0.012040 XPL and exactly equal the coinbase balance change. Burns were 8.1e-11, 3.7e-11 and 3.5e-11 XPL. The coinbase Safe returns threshold 5, the same 8 owners and nonce 7. Its Etherscan V2 txlist shows six swapOwner execTransactions plus one value-0 MultiSend (operation CALL). txlistinternal returns "No transactions found". Archive balance deltas at fresh blocks agree with the draft within 0.2%.

- Ecosystem metrics: chain TVL $425.6M (peak $6.36B on 2025-10-09; $551.7M on 2026-10-29). Stablecoins $1.506B (stablecoincharts) / $1.495B (stablecoinchains; the two endpoints are different snapshots), rank #9. Mix: USDT $972.0M, USDe $511.3M. Aave V3 Plasma: $357.0M net TVL and $672.9M borrowed, #4 chain. Aave 30d fees on Plasma: $2.96M. DEX volume: 24h $2.95M, 7d $21.4M, 30d $165.1M. Plasma One TVL: $1.07M (2026-05-07) → $13.16M (2026-10-04) → $30.87M (2026-11-10). Binance CEX holds $323.7M on Plasma. Tron's 30d fees: $24.53M.

