| Investors | 25% / 3.75B | Same as team (≈78.1M/month) | Accelerated: no investor tokens locked from 2026-10-05. The Foundation bought out OTC the locked tokens of seed investors (each originally >0.25% of supply) who had sold any ENA after 2025-10-10; the price was not disclosed [11] |

