#### What to watch for buybacks

- 14-day average of USDe totalSupply() crossing $7.5B. Ethereum totalSupply() also counts USDe pre-minted for L2 peg-stability modules; Ethena excludes USDe held by PSM custodian 0xD7fCaDe52aFb60FbF0E1E5F72A683F43820f56A0 (984 USDe on 2026-11-10) [8].

- Any new buyback wallet or auction contract announced on the forum or Transparency dashboard. Then track ENA Transfer events into it and (if burned) to 0x000…dEaD. The ENA contract has no native burn-supply tracking beyond totalSupply().

- Large-holder flows: Transfer events from the top EOAs listed in section 2 to exchange deposit addresses.

