| Catalyst | Date / status | Bullish if | Bearish if |

| --- | --- | --- | --- |

| USDe 14-day average supply crossing $7.5B (fee-switch rung 1) | Open; spot supply $4.96B on 2026-11-10; 14-day average ≈$4.65B (estimate) | Sustained mint growth (Sep 2026 added more than $700M [18]) | Redemption waves like July 2026 |

| Fee-switch implementation details (execution contract, burn or hold, continuity reserve, benchmark) | "Coming weeks" after 2026-09-08 [17]; not published by 2026-11-10 | Transparent on-chain auction plus burn | Discretionary or delayed execution |

| sENA rewards proposal (OAK Research) | Promised after the fee-switch vote [17] | Revenue share to sENA | Shelved |

| Master Framework Agreement publication | Expected October 2026 [11]; not found as of 2026-11-10 | Signed and published as described | Slips further or is watered down |

| Monthly team / Foundation / ecosystem vesting | Monthly to ~Mar 2028 | Foundation withholds releases | Visible Foundation or team selling |

| StablecoinX lock expiry (25% at the 12-month anniversary of closing) | Date not verified (PIPEs signed 2025-07-21 and 2025-09-05 [28]) | Holder keeps or stakes | Selling into the market |

| Crypto funding rates / OI | Continuous | Higher funding gives higher sUSDe APY and more supply | Negative funding draws on the Reserve Fund |

| Backing expansion: SAFO (up to $500M), GHO, mUSD, Aave V4, equity and gold basis | Q4 2026 [23][24][18] | Higher, diversified yield | A credit or counterparty event |

| Risk Committee 6th-term election | ~February 2027 (6-month terms [7]) | — | Governance disputes |

| Ethena Pay / Robinhood Chain / Coinbase / Kraken+ distribution numbers | Ongoing | Organic (non-incentivized) USDe growth | Growth only through paid rewards |

