- Aragon's buyback design was an informal forum suggestion, not a proposal; the Aave V4 $60M item is a Blockworks Advisory recommendation, not a confirmed cap change. "TGE 2024-03-05" relabelled as allocation date (trading began 2024-04-02). $14M round given the filing's caveat. Remaining vesting given as a range (3.0–3.2B).

