#### Unlock schedule

- Since 2026-07-24: community 3.2M→1.6M WLD/day; TFH 1.9M→1.3M/day; total ~5.1M→~2.9M/day (−43%) ([source](https://world.org/blog/foundational-topics/tokenomics-milestone-wld-unlock-rate-to-decrease-by-43-in-july)). That is ≈1.06B a year, ≈28% of circulating supply, ≈$0.90M a day at $0.309.

- Community VestingWallets (beneficiary: cold wallet, read on-chain). 0xaEE0…0e57: 1.75B, 2026-07-24 → 2029-07-24 (≈1.597M/day). 0x938c…77F7: 0.875B, 2029–2032. 0x5B54…7D93: 0.875B, 2032-07-24 → 2038-07-24.

- TFH unlocks end ~July 2028, with ~0.8B still locked (estimate).

- Unlocked ≠ circulating. Community tokens circulate only when the Foundation spends or sells them, so treasury flows (Section 5) matter more than the vesting curve.

- User-token emissions are small. 24h to 2026-11-10 15:37 UTC: the "Recurring User Token Amounts" hot wallet made 16,788 transfers totalling 13,857.68 WLD (≈5M a year). The "First User Token Amount" wallet made 1 transfer. Recurring Orb amounts: 3.22 WLD/month (Aug 2025), scheduled to fall to 1.36 by Aug 2026. First amounts: 25 WLD (Orb) and 12.5 WLD (passport) (whitepaper).

