| OpenAI link | Unscheduled | Official OpenAI integration of World ID | OpenAI chooses another method |

| Verified-human growth | Next official update | Clear rise above 18M | Flat |

| Regulation | Ongoing | Approvals in large markets | Bans or deletion orders |

| Inflation switch | Not before 2038-07-24 | — | Up to 1.5% a year |

